  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into 1 cm-thick wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine miso paste, the honey and vinegar.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat. Brush over miso mixture.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out the seeds, if necessary!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbbf58e45e3ca008631fe-d87c3bf9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice red radish and cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbbf58e45e3ca008631fe-9a11e157.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine garlic aioli, sesame oil blend (see ingredients), the low sodium soy sauce and a good squeeze of lemon juice.\n• When pumpkin is done, to bowl with the dressing, add deluxe salad mix, mixed salad leaves, radish, cucumber and crunchy fried noodles. Toss to combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbbf58e45e3ca008631fe-7e3ada2d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide crunchy rainbow salad between bowls.\n• Top with miso-glazed pumpkin.\n• Sprinkle with everything garnish (see ingredients). Top with pickled ginger. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbbf58e45e3ca008631fe-615bae25.jpeg"
    }
  ]
